# This dir is a tracked run record (measurement sweeps like rpo-sweep-*). Ephemeral
# output stays ignored: test/precommit logs are pruned daily, bench raw logs are
# superseded by the tracked ../scripts/perf_history.jsonl, server logs are local.
test-*.log
precommit*.log
bench-*.log
server-*.log
# Ad-hoc suite runs (e.g. the --include s3 repeat runs used to chase a flake).
s3-*.log
